1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:01,870
Laal chaand ki raat...

2
00:00:02,080 --> 00:00:04,218
jo saal mein sirf ek baar aati hai.

3
00:00:04,258 --> 00:00:05,158
Is raat,

4
00:00:05,198 --> 00:00:07,398
sakura ke ped jaag uthte hain...

5
00:00:07,658 --> 00:00:10,026
aur poora shehar chup ho jaata hai.

6
00:00:10,066 --> 00:00:11,476
Aur tabhi wo aayi.

7
00:00:11,816 --> 00:00:12,866
Ek talwar...

8
00:00:12,906 --> 00:00:14,499
aur aankhon mein aag.

9
00:00:14,539 --> 00:00:15,539
Kaun thi wo?

10
00:00:15,869 --> 00:00:17,109
Kisi ne poocha nahi.

11
00:00:17,499 --> 00:00:19,724
Kyunki uske peeche kuch aur bhi tha.

12
00:00:19,764 --> 00:00:20,894
Ek oni.

13
00:00:21,254 --> 00:00:22,634
Chehra chhupa hua...

14
00:00:22,704 --> 00:00:23,964
naam bhoola hua,

15
00:00:24,254 --> 00:00:25,427
sadiyon purana.

16
00:00:25,467 --> 00:00:27,617
Bade ped ke neeche dono ruke...

17
00:00:27,847 --> 00:00:29,106
aur hawa bhi ruk gayi.

18
00:00:29,146 --> 00:00:30,016
Ek vaar.

19
00:00:30,326 --> 00:00:31,086
Patte,

20
00:00:31,326 --> 00:00:32,006
aag...

21
00:00:32,266 --> 00:00:33,186
aur khoon.

22
00:00:33,226 --> 00:00:34,576
Jab chaand dala,

23
00:00:34,616 --> 00:00:35,876
to kuch nahi bacha.

24
00:00:36,136 --> 00:00:37,406
Sirf ek talwar...

25
00:00:37,566 --> 00:00:39,075
aur ek toota hua mask.

26
00:00:39,115 --> 00:00:40,475
Kiski thi wo talwar?

27
00:00:40,625 --> 00:00:42,305
Aaj bhi koi nahi jaanta.

28
00:00:42,455 --> 00:00:43,485
Part 2 chahiye?

29
00:00:43,525 --> 00:00:44,385
Comment karo...

30
00:00:44,525 --> 00:00:45,203
SAKURA.
